abstract: Aggregate observational research pipeline with temporal splits, synthetic
  tests, and an exploratory metadata-only engagement analysis. No Reddit data or per-user
  predictions are distributed. Version 0.1.0 was published as manuscript sources and
  code; no compiled PDF is included. The study is not peer-reviewed.
